---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Icon from '../components/Icon.astro';
---
<Layout title='Work — Jennie Muso' description='Selected websites by Jennie Muso: Veyra Cargo, Bayline Legal, JIN Restaurant, and Nacre Dental.' current='work' styles={['fonts.css','styles.css','editorial.css','projects.css','reference-layout.css','refinements.css']} bodyClass="work-page">
<div class="page-intro"><h1>THE WORK.</h1><p>Four websites. Four very different businesses. Each one starts with the same question: what does this audience need to feel, understand, and do?</p></div><section class="work" id="work" aria-label="Selected websites"><div class="section-head"><h2>Selected work</h2></div><div class="work-grid">
<article class="work-item work-item-a"><div class="work-media"><img src="/assets/case-studies/veyra-hero.webp" alt="Veyra cargo ship at the port" loading="lazy"></div><div class="work-caption"><h3>Veyra Cargo</h3><span>Website design & development</span></div><a class="work-card-link" href="/work/veyra-cargo/" aria-label="View Veyra Cargo case study"></a></article>
<article class="work-item work-item-b"><div class="work-media"><img src="/assets/case-studies/bayline-hero.webp" alt="Bayline Legal professionals in conversation" loading="lazy"></div><div class="work-caption"><h3>Bayline Legal</h3><span>Website design & development</span></div><a class="work-card-link" href="/work/bayline-legal/" aria-label="View Bayline Legal case study"></a></article>
<article class="work-item work-item-c"><div class="work-media"><img src="/assets/case-studies/jin-hero.webp" alt="JIN restaurant dining room" loading="lazy"></div><div class="work-caption"><h3>JIN Restaurant</h3><span>Website design & development</span></div><a class="work-card-link" href="/work/jin-restaurant/" aria-label="View JIN Restaurant case study"></a></article>
<article class="work-item work-item-d"><div class="work-media"><img src="/assets/case-studies/nacre-hero.webp" alt="A smiling woman featured on the Nacre Dental website" loading="lazy"></div><div class="work-caption"><h3>Nacre Dental</h3><span>Website design & development</span></div><a class="work-card-link" href="/work/nacre-dental/" aria-label="View Nacre Dental case study"></a></article>
</div><div class="work-end"><p class="work-note">Four different briefs, each shaped around its audience. Select a project to explore the design, the build and the details behind it.</p><a class="text-link" href="/contact/">Discuss a project <Icon name="ArrowUpRight" size={20} /></a></div></section>
</Layout>
